    {"id":"l3","unit":"u6","titleFr":"Les adjectifs","titleAr":"الصفات: مذكر ومؤنث","vocabulary":[["grand/grande","كبير/كبيرة"],["petit/petite","صغير/صغيرة"],["long/longue","طويل/طويلة"],["court/courte","قصير/قصيرة"],["gros/grosse","بدين/بدينة"],["mince","نحيف/نحيفة"],["maigre","هزيل/هزيلة"]],"grammar":"غالبًا نضيف e للمؤنث، وبعض الصفات لها تغيير إملائي مثل gros→grosse وlong→longue.","examples":["Il est grand.","Elle est grande.","Mon père est long.","Ma mère est courte."],"practice":[{"id":"p1","q":"Elle est ___. (grand)","options":["grand","grande","grands"],"answer":1},{"id":"p2","q":"Il est ___. (gros)","options":["gros","grosse","grosses"],"answer":0},{"id":"p3","q":"Elles sont ___. (mince)","options":["mince","minces","minceses"],"answer":1}]},
